OL,3,AConsultant doctors in England to strike
OL,4,Anext month
OL,5,
OL,6,FConsultant doctors in England are to
OL,7,Fstage a two-day strike next month in a
OL,8,Fdispute over pay and working
OL,9,Fconditions.
OL,11,FThe walkout will begin on 25 November
OL,12,Fat 06:59 GMT, with consultants
OL,13,Fproviding emergency cover only.
OL,15,FIt comes after 76% of consultants who
OL,16,Ftook part in the British Medical
OL,17,FAssociation ballot voted in favour of
OL,18,Fstrike action earlier this year with
OL,19,Fturnout was just over 50%.
OL,21,FTalks had taken place with the
OL,22,Fgovernment over the past month.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
